# §603 — COMPLETE JIT ENABLEMENT for the westlake OHOS arm64 port (2026-08-10)
#
# Consolidates every source change needed to run the JIT: §601 (enable) + §603f (§436 guard)
# + §603h (the render/artwork fix) + §603i (mini-debug-info) + the AOT-adjacent §602/§603 bits.
#
# ⚠️THE CHANGES SPAN TWO TREES. The Makefiles compile a MIXTURE:
#     art-latest/patches/**  (explicit per-file list in Makefile.ohos-arm64 -- NOT a glob)
#     aosp-art-15/**         (everything not in that list, incl. headers and common_throws.cc)
#   Apply part A in $WLROOT/art-latest and part B in $WLROOT/aosp-art-15.
#
# Build:  cd $WLROOT/art-latest && make -f Makefile.ohos-arm64 -j16 all
#         bash $WLROOT/bridge-build-arm64/build_libart_so_arm64.sh
# ⚠️The Makefile has NO header dependency tracking: after editing any .h you MUST delete the
#   dependent .o by hand (e.g. build-ohos-arm64/compiler/driver/compiler_options.o) or nothing
#   rebuilds and the md5 will not change. ALWAYS byte-verify a marker string in out/libart.so.
#
# Verify: APPSPAWNX_FORCE_JIT=1 via ab_render.sh; the oracle is the sound-library row artwork
#   (~125 000 B screenshot = good, ~113 800 B = the ArrayStoreException bug, ~36 900 B = not drawn yet).
#
# ================================ PART A: art-latest ================================
